# Working directory

- All scripts should be executed from the src/polarbert subdirectory.
- You can safely assume that script executed by the user will be executed from the src/polarbert subdirectory.
- Before executing a script yourself, ALWAYS check the current directory, and `cd` to src/polarbert (from the directory root) if needed.
- The Python package `polarbert` is installed in development mode and can be accessed from anywhere without having to add it to the path.
